{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "def fib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number.\n    >>> fib(10)\n    55\n    >>> fib(1)\n    1\n    >>> fib(8)\n    21\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    else:\n        a, b = 0, 1\n        for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n            a, b = b, a + b\n        return b"}
